      "content": "that's a bit of a poetic way to put it lol. but i need more technical detail for my report. specifically, when looking at the reduction or oxidation in the cross-section, what kind of color gradients or core discoloration should i expect to see in a pit-fired vessel versus one fired in a closed kiln environment?",
